  "notable_quotes": [
    "A suitable channel space with judiciously combined positive and negative sites is a design principle for capturing complex C2/CO2 impurity mixtures.",
    "The earlier Zn-atz-oba material realized one-step C2H4 purification, but its low separation selectivity led to unsatisfactory separation performance.",
    "Traps tailored for C2H6 over C2H4 can favor C2H6 adsorption, but their weak affinity is not sufficient for deep removal of trace C2H2 and CO2."
